# ================================================================
# KILLER v2.3 — vs WORLD AI SERVICES
# ChatGPT · Claude · Perplexity · Gemini · Grok · Mistral · Llama
# ================================================================
#
# KEY INSIGHT:
#   ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity etc. are SERVICES you call.
#   Killer is a LANGUAGE with AI built in.
#
#   Killer can:
#     (A) BE the AI  — native think/imagine/affect/search/memory
#     (B) USE any AI — khlm_set_llm connects to any service in 1 line
#
#   No other language in the world does both.
# ================================================================

